{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:gh_68f37a80b8cb","title":"黑鸟","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxOTM1MDQ1NA==&mid=2451189924&idx=1&sn=099638d0275fa422730e578e7e62e832&chksm=8d875f83dd51d1fbf52f09cbb95ca137e7b810b3b0c4d40a6527a45cd872336786cd2832896a&scene=126&sessionid=1795076046#rd","description":"一介草民，深耕威胁情报领域多年，自封威胁分析师，APT狩猎者，战略忽悠分析师。 专注推送一切前沿高科技/人工智能、网络安全分析、敌我战略分析、数据挖掘、情报扩线、网络武器分析、社会工程学、一切开源情报、军事分析忽悠等。","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"黑鸟","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2FX4XEGYefSBSxrDYncLtKiacf7vZpHQnuLDMVc1rQjZsw9xYSM6kSCezibImssYuBjTibclnyop737M%2F0","updated":"2026-11-18T17:00:42.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:MzAxOTM1MDQ1NA%3D%3D:2451189924:1","title":"NGINX2Root：普通访问者直达服务器root权限","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxOTM1MDQ1NA==&mid=2451189924&idx=1&sn=099638d0275fa422730e578e7e62e832&chksm=8d875f83dd51d1fbf52f09cbb95ca137e7b810b3b0c4d40a6527a45cd872336786cd2832896a&scene=126&sessionid=1795076046#rd","description":"NGINX2Root漏洞组合曝光，5个CVE漏洞可从普通访问者提升至服务器root权限，影响广泛。建议立即升级NGINX版本，关闭不必要的模块。","content":"<p>NGINX2Root漏洞组合曝光，5个CVE漏洞可从普通访问者提升至服务器root权限，影响广泛。建议立即升级NGINX版本，关闭不必要的模块。</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FibO9kiauylaDpqNgIsrl24Hqia3kSElM6bYHa0w5oXXqGaicBjmNTXJNibb7Dd8oGYD0x2MiaZslV56F7EJqzj4oDI4U0GibOPqLRiboOibUFdyXiaicJk%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FibO9kiauylaDqxP3hVI8CpZ7icjoLOdCIuAVP8VVysqicOlpFpkxNibO32rzHiaOf9FSVXmHCjOFojNJJZ3sF5MI91VnHX3jOkL2H9nNFOr0sfcRg%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FibO9kiauylaDrJvrnyhKZkiaib9tkoGHDicd